{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A clearer pulse for your day</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Practical habits, simple frameworks, a personal plan you can use today.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Paths</a>
        <a href="services.html">Sessions</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" style="background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-inner reveal" data-reveal>
          <h1 class="title">Guideposts for steadier days</h1>
          <p class="lede">A hybrid approach: short guided sessions plus practical habits to shape your energy and routines. No jargon — only usable steps.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="programs.html">Explore Paths</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="social-proof wrap reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2>What people notice</h2>
      <ul class="proof-list">
        <li>"Practical and quiet—helped me reclaim small windows of focus." — Maya, {{CITY}}</li>
        <li>"A calm structure that actually fits my mornings." — Tomas, {{STATE}}</li>
        <li>"I learned tiny habits that changed my week." — Aisha</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="benefits wrap reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2>Outcomes I support</h2>
      <p class="sub">Workable frameworks, daily micro-habits, and check-in points to keep progress honest.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Anchor Practices</h3>
          <p>Short daily rituals that settle attention and reduce decision fatigue.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Energy Maps</h3>
          <p>Simple templates to spot where and when you feel most resourceful — then use it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Flexible Routines</h3>
          <p>Habits that bend with life, not against it. Small constraints, big clarity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="process wrap reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2>How we move together</h2>
      <ol class="process-list">
        <li><strong>Listen & map:</strong> We clarify where energy feels thin and where momentum appears.</li>
        <li><strong>Design one shift:</strong> A single, concrete change you can try this week.</li>
        <li><strong>Practice + review:</strong> Short check-ins, refine the steps, amplitude small wins.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="session-planner" id="session-planner">
        <h3>Session Planner</h3>
        <p class="small">Build a short, personalized plan and copy a plaintext summary to your clipboard.</p>
        <form id="planner-form">
          <label>Name
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" />
          </label>

          <label>Primary focus
            <select name="focus">
              <option value="clarity">Clearer focus</option>
              <option value="energy">Steady energy</option>
              <option value="routine">Smoother routines</option>
              <option value="sleep">Better rest rhythms</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <label>Session length (minutes)
            <input type="number" name="duration" min="10" max="90" value="30" />
          </label>

          <fieldset class="checkboxes">
            <legend>Prefer to include</legend>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="habits" value="breath" checked /> Breath cue</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="habits" value="movement" /> Micro movement</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="habits" value="intake" /> Hydration checkpoint</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="habits" value="reflection" /> Quick reflection</label>
          </fieldset>

          <div class="planner-actions">
            <button type="button" id="build-plan" class="btn">Build plan</button>
            <button type="button" id="copy-plan" class="btn ghost" disabled>Copy summary</button>
            <button type="button" id="download-plan" class="btn ghost" disabled>Download</button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <pre id="plan-output" aria-live="polite"></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq wrap reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2>Questions I often get</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>Is this coaching a one-time fix?</summary>
        <p>No. I design small, repeatable changes and check-ins. The aim is lasting adjustments, not quick cures.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do I need to commit a lot of time?</summary>
        <p>Sessions are focused; the core work is a few minutes per day with short weekly reviews.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Will this replace medical advice?</summary>
        <p>These are habit and routine frameworks, not medical recommendations.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="final-cta wrap reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2>Ready to shape your next week</h2>
      <p class="sub">Book a short intake to get a custom path and a simple plan you can try immediately.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn primary" href="book.html">Reserve a slot</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="contact.html">Ask a question</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>Contact: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();</script>
</body>
</html>"} 
